-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The donor search in the Texture fill (`_transplant_grain` in
dust_removal_gui.py) is a Python port of `findBestPatch` from DarkSlide's
src/utils/dustRemoval.ts, adapted from RGB to greyscale. It keeps that
function's search geometry - three radii at 2.1, 2.9 and 3.9 times the blob
radius, sixteen candidate angles at each, and a score summing the absolute tone
difference and a weighted absolute gradient difference. The gradient weight
itself is not carried over; it is set independently here.

DarkSlide: https://github.com/kilianvivien/DarkSlide

